      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">The only landfill in the Barwon region licensed to take asbestos sits here in Drysdale, which makes disposal simpler from this end of the Bellarine than almost anywhere else in the region. If you are not sure what the sheeting is, get it tested before you touch it.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;">
